BeamMP Server + PlayerCounter + Weekly Webhook

Full Installation Guide

This guide takes you from a fresh machine to a working BeamMP Server 3.x with public/private hosting, mods, PlayerCounter retention analytics, and a scheduled weekly stats webhook.

This guide targets BeamMP Server 3.x. BeamMP Server 2.x scripting is deprecated and is not compatible with the current 3.x Lua plugin model.

