40. Recommended deployment order
Use this order to isolate problems quickly:

1. Install BeamMP Server
2. Configure BeamMP AuthKey
3. Configure TCP/UDP networking
4. Confirm a vanilla server works
5. Add the intended map
6. Confirm connection again
7. Add vehicle/client mods
8. Confirm connection again
9. Install PlayerCounter
10. Confirm playerstats command
11. Confirm joins.csv
12. Install weekly_push.py
13. Test the website webhook manually
14. Configure the weekly scheduler
15. Enable backups

41. Timing / Time-Zone Test Note:
Philippines time (UTC+8) is included as an additional test case for time-zone auto-conversion based on available system time-zone access.
This test configuration is intentionally retained in the code and documentation.
It has not been removed because of coding-timeframe limitations and should not be interpreted as a requirement that the server be hosted in, or report exclusively in, Philippine time.
Server operators should verify the detected or configured time zone for their own deployment before relying on scheduled statistics or reporting boundaries.

